    {
      "source": "Set whether a shared singleton <code>PropertiesBasedNamedQueries</code> instance should be created, or rather a new\n<code>PropertiesBasedNamedQueries</code> instance on each request.",
      "translation": "设置是否应创建共享的单一实例 `<code>PropertiesBasedNamedQueries</code>`，或者在每次请求时创建一个新的 `<code>PropertiesBasedNamedQueries</code>` 实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
